### 593-category-delete-leaf.http — issue #593
### CASE-06. (Category) 하위/참조가 없는 카테고리는 정상적으로 삭제된다

### 1. 관리자 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@earlybird.co.kr",
  "password": "rawPassword3!"
}

> {%
    client.test("관리자 로그인 성공", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
    client.global.set("adminAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 2. 말단 카테고리 C 등록 (parent 없음, 하위/참조 없음)
< {% client.global.set("catCName", "usecase593-C-" + Date.now()); %}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "{{catCName}}" }

> {%
    client.test("C 등록 성공", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
    client.global.set("categoryCId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 3. C 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories/{{categoryCId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

> {%
    client.test("C 삭제 성공", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "delete failed: " + response.body);
    });
%}

### 4. 삭제 확인 — 재조회 시 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories/{{categoryCId}}

> {%
    client.test("삭제된 카테고리 재조회 -> 404", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "expected 404, got " + response.status);
    });
%}
